	(text "Primary LEDs are driven by TPS2373 open-drain outputs referenced to POE_RTN.\nSecondary outputs: PB10 / PB11 / PB12 (MCU pads 22 / 23 / 24), active low.\nClass 6 grant: TPH_N=0, TPL_N=1, BT_N=0, stable after startup.\nReject all other combinations. Keep MAIN5V, modem and Ethernet power off until grant.\n6.8k limits each LED to <2.3mA at 15V; TPS2373 recommended sink <=3mA.\n12k collector pull-up and 10nF filter. Verify CTR/leakage at -40 to 85C and bias corners.\nAll-high also means unpowered / invalid status. Loss of grant cuts main loads.\nDo not join POE_RTN, POE_VSS or POE_VDD to secondary GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
